ernator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Knight Territory Hibernator.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A commonly seen burly knight whose Knightclub affiliation is unknown, considered rogue. They're often found passed out drunk in dark alleyways, and should be avoided as they demonstrate ferociously violent tendencies when woken up.","abilities":["Remains Standby for a certain period in areas with <no visibility> and does not attack","If visibility is gained on its location, immediately becomes active"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":8500,"atk":1000,"def":550,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"nightzmora_imitator":{"slug":"nightzmora_imitator","name":"Nightzmora Imitator","icon":"/enemies-icons/Nightzmora Imitator.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Pretenders who began following Nightmare Knight after his battles and 'Performance Art'. Though the form is true, the substance is lacking. Perhaps they can be considered a type of fan as well.","abilities":["[Coalescing Fear] Deals Physical damage to all operators with no visibility directly behind them"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":1200,"def":700,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"tiacauh_brave":{"slug":"tiacauh_brave","name":"Tiacauh Brave","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tiacauh Brave.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A very formidable Tiacauh warrior, naturally born to do battle. These warriors harbor great pride in their combat abilities, and live for the thrill of the duel no matter where they are. Their single-mindedness allows them to shrug off al